LOCATION:Norths Rugby Club / Ballymore Stadium
DESCRIPTION:Pool play finished Friday - today is knockouts.\nNo Fog side 
 is knocked out on pool results alone - every side moves into a finals br
 acket (Bingham: Cup\, Plate\, Bowl or Shield / Challenger: Cup\, Vase or
  Beer Stein).\nToday's fixtures are set once Friday's pools finish - CHE
 CK RUGBY XPLORER FRIDAY EVENING.\n\nReport to your coach 1 hour 15 minut
 es before kickoff.\nBring PHOTO ID and PLAYER BADGE - officials check bo
 th. No ID or no badge means no game.\nGrounds can change day to day - ch
 eck Rugby Xplorer each morning.\nLunch is provided. All fields are natur
 al grass.\nField locations and transport: https://binghamcup2026.com/mat
 ch-fields
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
